## Working rules

- Inspect existing solutions before building custom machinery. When asked for a capability, first
  check whether it already exists — report what you found rather than rebuilding it.
- Before editing a deployed artifact (an image definition, a config file), trace which artifact
  the running system actually consumes — never guess from filenames.
- Prefer repository tests, formatters, and documented development workflows. Report concrete
